Nike, their service providers, and third parties collect information from your browser, devices, or apps when you use their Platform using methods such as cookies, pixel tags, mobile device identifiers, and similar technologies. The information collected may include your IP address, unique cookie identifier and information obtained through cookies, unique device identifier and device type, domain, browser type and language, operating system and system settings, country and time zone, previously visited websites, information about your interaction with the Platform (such as click behavior, purchases, and indicated preferences), and access times and referring URLs. Nike uses these technologies to:
* Analyze and understand how you access, use, and interact with the Platform and your consumer preferences (such as country and language choices);
* Assess, secure, protect, optimize, and improve the performance of the Platform to provide services and improve your online experience;
* Obtain aggregate data about Platform traffic and interaction to conduct analytics, identify trends, and obtain statistics to improve the Platform; and
* Target advertising and content across the Platform and third-party sites and services.

